# Judge9-1-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:到头来，<br>是谁在<br>二阶堂前面<br>上的电梯啊？|#0204Trial01_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可、可能是大叔我吧？|#0204Trial01_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:但我上电梯的时候<br>根本没看见尸体啊！|#0204Trial01_Miria002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,55 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我和雪莉在上层，<br>亲眼看到<br>米莉亚从电梯里<br>出来的哇……|#0204Trial01_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但是电梯里<br>并<link=\"Objection_02_04_01_01\">没有</link><br>艾玛的尸体啊。|#0204Trial01_Sherry001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"电梯里<br>也<link=\"Objection_02_04_01_02\">没地方能躲起来</link>……<br>|#0204Trial01_Sherry002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"总、<br>总之大叔我<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_01_03\">什么都没做</link>啦！|#0204Trial01_Miria003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这么说来，<br>凶手只能是二阶堂了吧。|#0204Trial01_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:电梯下降之后，<br>二阶堂杀害了樱羽。<br>|#0204Trial01_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……又或者是，<br>把<link=\"Objection_02_04_01_04\">事先杀害</link><br>的尸体搬过来，<br>然后装作自己是刚发现的。|#0204Trial01_Alisa004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:只有这几种<br>可能了吧。|#0204Trial01_Alisa005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


